00:44.331 --> 00:51.799
we could actually feel The grid is heavy, but the

00:51.899 --> 00:59.413
signals run clear We're standing on the edge And

00:59.493 --> 01:05.200
there is nothing left to fear Concrete angels In

01:06.341 --> 01:14.690
the midnight rain Riding out the storm On a

01:14.771 --> 01:21.331
moving train We don't need a map, we don't need a

01:21.351 --> 01:27.194
