01:27.354 --> 01:31.475
Concrete angels taking flight

01:34.917 --> 01:41.319
The overpass is glowing Like a halo in the dark

01:42.940 --> 01:50.663
Every single shadow Is a place to leave a mark We

01:50.703 --> 01:57.227
