02:38.457 --> 02:40.138
Hold the line

02:43.117 --> 02:49.968
Find the light in the

02:50.369 --> 02:51.570
empty space

03:23.231 --> 03:31.456
Concrete angels in the midnight rain Riding out

03:31.476 --> 03:40.661
the storm on a moving train We don't need a map, we

03:40.741 --> 03:45.123
